      "enum": [
        "interface-inspected",
        "documentation-inspected",
        "repository-inspected",
        "data-inspected",
        "locally-run"
      ],
      "description": "interface-inspected: Specific visible interface elements were inspected, not its hidden implementation.\ndocumentation-inspected: Documentation was read; its claims are not independently executed results.\nrepository-inspected: Named source files were read; their execution or advertised correctness is not established.\ndata-inspected: Named data records or exports were inspected, not the whole collection.\nlocally-run: A dated bounded path was executed with recorded inputs/environment/results; not full reproducibility.",
      "x-labels": {
